    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是個香水調香師……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F500B99996C348ABF99995E2B20262026001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "會用粉香香這種寶可夢\n散發的香氣來調製香水。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "670375287C899999999990197A2E5BF653EF5922000A6563767C768499996C234F868ABF88FD99996C343002001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "粉香香身上散發的香氣\n會隨著餵給牠的食物而改變。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7C89999999998EAB4E0A6563767C768499996C23000A670396A8845799357D667260768498DF7269800C65398B8A3002001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我這次要讓粉香香吃的是\n各式各樣的樹果！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621190196B2189818B937C899999999954037684662F000A54045F0F54046A2376846A39679CFF01001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "內容是\n20個櫻子果、<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n5個茄番果，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n巧可果也是5個！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51675BB9662F000A00320030500B6AFB5B50679C300100100001BE00000A0035500B8304756A679CFF0C00100001BE00000A5DE753EF679C4E5F662F0035500BFF01001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "粉？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7C89FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是呢，\n我有點傷腦筋……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F5462FF0C000A621167099EDE50B781667B4B20262026001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果在路上聞到了各種氣味，\n我就會沒辦法好好地調製香水！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C57288DEF4E0A805E52304E8654047A2E6C235473FF0C000A62115C3167036C928FA66CD5597D597D57308ABF88FD99996C34FF01001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳代替我\n準備樹果吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE58ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B34EE366FF6211000A6E9650996A39679C5427FF01001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "各式各樣的樹果可以在城市裡回收，\n或是請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳從商店裡買來就再好不過了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54045F0F54046A2376846A39679C53EF4EE5572857CE5E0288E156DE6536FF0C000A6216662F8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B35F9E55465E9788E18CB74F865C31518D597D4E0D904E4E86FF01001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請把20個櫻子果、\n5個茄番果<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n和5個巧可果讓給我吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
